msgstr "Regenerate the key? The current one will stop working immediately and you will have to update it in the app that uses it."

msgid "Rigenera"
msgstr "Regenerate"

msgid "Revocare la chiave? Le app che la usano non potranno più creare task."
msgstr "Revoke the key? Apps using it will no longer be able to create tasks."

msgid "Revoca"
msgstr "Revoke"

